00:17:35.610 --> 00:17:39.620
I think people who can skip school
whenever they see fit are probably smarter.

00:17:39.910 --> 00:17:42.370
Is that why you didn't show up
to the entrance ceremony?

00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:44.790
It was just coincidence that I missed the bus.

00:17:44.960 --> 00:17:49.840
