I simply wanted to obtain.

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:09.690
Really?

00:18:09.690 --> 00:18:13.690
Yeah. That's probably why I went into the marble.

00:18:14.230 --> 00:18:18.070
The view is squished and warped, and also inverted.

00:18:18.070 --> 00:18:21.700
I went into a marble because
it was making fun of the world.

00:18:24.450 --> 00:18:26.710
I don't think that's the case.

00:18:27.660 --> 00:18:29.790
Why do you think so?

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:34.000
