00:18:44.010 --> 00:18:45.350
"Student Monitor"...

00:18:46.180 --> 00:18:48.350
That's what everyone called me.

00:18:48.690 --> 00:18:53.860
I always believed that abiding by
the rules was the pure thing to do.

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:58.780
I never broke the rules,
and when someone did, I warned them.

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:02.120
After about a month,
the "Student Monitor" nickname spread.

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:08.290
People stopped talking to me during breaks
and asking me to hang out with them after school.

00:19:08.290 --> 00:19:12.130
I was just simply choosing pure things!

00:19:12.920 --> 00:19:15.630
But no one else seemed to care about them.

00:19:16.340 --> 00:19:20.800
Everyone said that your greatest
trait is your responsibility.

00:19:21.050 --> 00:19:25.350
Yeah, so I'm going to get used to being carefree.

00:19:25.350 --> 00:19:28.520
But I don't think that's what you want.

00:19:28.520 --> 00:19:30.100
Why?

00:19:30.100 --> 00:19:33.230
I heard all sorts of things.

00:19:34.190 --> 00:19:37.940
Three strawberry-flavored ones
and two ramune-flavored ones...

00:19:38.490 --> 00:19:40.450
making a total of five Candy Candy.

00:19:40.650 --> 00:19:44.370
I accidentally brought them to school,
so I left them with my homeroom teacher.

00:19:44.660 --> 00:19:49.500
In your middle school, you weren't allowed
to eat candy inside the building.

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:53.080
Your plan was to actually eat it at school, wasn't it?

00:19:53.080 --> 00:19:53.920
Yeah.

00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:56.920
