00:20:18.650 --> 00:20:22.990
The hands indicating it was noon were turned
upside-down, and it looked like it was morning.

00:20:23.360 --> 00:20:26.280
You wished to be in that world, right?

00:20:26.280 --> 00:20:28.120
You wanted to escape to a world

00:20:28.120 --> 00:20:31.960
