it doesn't look upside-down to me anymore!

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:48.220
Which means that being inside
the marble doesn't change anything.

00:20:48.510 --> 00:20:49.350
Yeah.

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:54.100
